{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人莊思敏（Jacquelin）早前因在社交網分享母親喪禮片段，引起胞妹莊思華不滿，惹來姊妹不和揣測，然而，一家人邊有隔夜仇，原來兩人早已雨過天青，並孖另一胞妹莊思明搞生意，實行姊妹同心，其利斷金。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T02:23:52.517101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T02:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:15.730818+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:15.730818+00:00","content_hash":"bd52f7c0ef4bb54017f3f3fdca381fea02a1a8551b21db66c3b88050a0f032a3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}